{
 "description": "Return a $0.01 native Base USDC x402 challenge without paying. For execution supply a verified enrollment, private read token, idempotency key and caller-created payment_signature or headers.PAYMENT-SIGNATURE. Only that payment header is accepted; enrollment/read token/idempotency remain explicit. Never creates a wallet signature. Returns bounded independent HTTP assertions, not security or full-application certification.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
